{"id":"n70003-1-8","stage":2,"title":"월말 · 月末","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n70003-1-8-1","ko":"요즘 회사 일이 많이 바쁘세요?","zh":"最近公司的工作很忙吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"요즘","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"회사","meaning":"公司，企业，会社","explanation":"회사：公司，企业，会社","readings":[{"term":"회사","audio":"/audio/a109dcd7f6f11c2e1703.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31668","senseId":"1","lemma":"회사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"일이","meaning":"事，工作","explanation":"일：事，工作；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"5","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"바쁘세요?","meaning":"忙，忙碌，紧张","explanation":"바쁘다：忙，忙碌，紧张；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"바쁘다","audio":"/audio/23457023f6034aaf6759.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66248","senseId":"1","lemma":"바쁘다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"828c4030dd68aa7b","term":"요즘","zh":"最近，近来，这阵子","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3","entryId":"20250","definition":"从非常近的过去到现在之间。","pronunciation":["요즘"]},{"id":"a109dcd7f6f11c2e","term":"회사","zh":"公司，企业，会社","audio":"/audio/a109dcd7f6f11c2e1703.mp3","entryId":"31668","definition":"想要通过事业获得利益的许多人一起建立的法人团体。","pronunciation":["회ː사","훼ː사"]},{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"事，工作","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"91895","definition":"需要解决或处理的问题或事项。","pronunciation":["일ː"]},{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准地。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"23457023f6034aaf","term":"바쁘다","zh":"忙，忙碌，紧张","audio":"/audio/23457023f6034aaf6759.mp3","entryId":"66248","definition":"因为要做的事情多或没有时间而无暇顾及其他。","pronunciation":["바쁘다"]}],"audio":"/audio/c77a6aa28087de553eff.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n70003-1-8-2","ko":"네, 월말이라서 정신이 하나도 없네요.","zh":"是的，因为是月底，简直忙得不可开交呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"월말이라서","meaning":"月末，月底","explanation":"월말：月末，月底；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；라서：名词判断或 아니다 后的原因表达：“因为是、因为不是”。","readings":[{"term":"월말","audio":"/audio/3bba416d8ae66de51995.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70003","senseId":"1","lemma":"월말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"정신이","meaning":"精神，意识","explanation":"정신：精神，意识；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"정신","audio":"/audio/2c3d6b050d278eb5e5ed.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75789","senseId":"3","lemma":"정신","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하나도","meaning":"完全","explanation":"하나：完全；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"하나","audio":"/audio/556dcbf069a950eb94f3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20283","senseId":"4","lemma":"하나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"없네요.","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"11","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于肯定回答长辈所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"3bba416d8ae66de5","term":"월말","zh":"月末，月底","audio":"/audio/3bba416d8ae66de51995.mp3","entryId":"70003","definition":"那个月的结束时分。","pronunciation":["월말"]},{"id":"2c3d6b050d278eb5","term":"정신","zh":"精神，意识","audio":"/audio/2c3d6b050d278eb5e5ed.mp3","entryId":"75789","definition":"心态。","pronunciation":["정신"]},{"id":"556dcbf069a950eb","term":"하나","zh":"完全","audio":"/audio/556dcbf069a950eb94f3.mp3","entryId":"20283","definition":"全然，毫无。","pronunciation":["하나"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"没有","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"不具有某物，或不具备资格、能力。","pronunciation":["업ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/95a81c96d612ef69d9cd.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.08,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=70003","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":71,"sequenceScore":1.9067,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["是的，因为是月底，简直忙得不可开交呢。","最近公司的工作很忙吗？","那部话剧怎么样？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["最近公司的工作很忙吗？","那部话剧怎么样？","是的，因为是月底，简直忙得不可开交呢。"],"answer":2}]}
